### Annual summary with the previous calendar-year comparison
GET http://127.0.0.1:5088/_analytics/sample-data/benchmark-api/summary?site=benchmark-results&tz=UTC&from=2026-01-01&to=2026-12-31&compare=previous-period
Accept: application/json
Cache-Control: no-cache

### Country breakdown for GitHub traffic, using the source-leading rollup index
GET http://127.0.0.1:5088/_analytics/sample-data/benchmark-api/breakdown?site=benchmark-results&tz=UTC&from=2026-01-01&to=2026-12-31&compare=previous-period&dimension=country&limit=5&includeSessionMetrics=false&filter=source%3D%3DGitHub
Accept: application/json
Cache-Control: no-cache

### Source breakdown for /blog, using the page-leading rollup index
GET http://127.0.0.1:5088/_analytics/sample-data/benchmark-api/breakdown?site=benchmark-results&tz=UTC&from=2026-01-01&to=2026-12-31&compare=previous-period&dimension=source&limit=5&includeSessionMetrics=false&filter=page%3D%3D%2Fblog
Accept: application/json
Cache-Control: no-cache
